&lt;p&gt;Postman is the world&#x27;s leading API platform, used by more than 30 million developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#x27;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build and scale backend services in Node.js that power collections, workspaces and the public API network&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design RESTful APIs backed by MongoDB, PostgreSQL and Redis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Own features end-to-end: design, testing, deployment and monitoring on AWS&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#x27;ll Need&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience (internships count) building backend services with JavaScript, TypeScript or Go&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Solid computer science fundamentals: data structures, algorithms, operating systems and networking&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience designing REST APIs on relational or document databases&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker, Kubernetes and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exposure to microservices and event-driven architectures with Kafka&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
